check_results.py compares MonOrm (Python and JS) with SQLAlchemy and Prisma
for the same ids on all 7 queries and fails on any difference or leftover row.
The other tools build a small dataset, load it into one local Postgres
database (schema sa for SQLAlchemy), and point SQLAlchemy to it.

